<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 145 FOR FIVE AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 145 FOR FIVE AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 145 for five in their first innings in reply to South Africa's 529 for seven declared at lunch on the third day of the second test in Cape Town on Saturday.</p>
</text>
